WEBVTT

00:13.312 --> 00:15.525
[Smoking is detrimental to your health.]

00:15.987 --> 00:18.739
[This story is based on
actual people and events]

00:18.740 --> 00:21.003
[but they have been dramatized
for artistic purposes.]

00:22.489 --> 00:24.940
[When you are young, you think it is easy
to give up a love.]

00:24.941 --> 00:27.700
[For you think the happiest and the newest
would come in the future.]

00:27.701 --> 00:30.097
[May be that is the case.
But what you do not know is that]

00:30.098 --> 00:33.194
[what we want and need the most
only comes once in life.]

00:33.195 --> 00:35.195
[Trịnh Công Sơn]

02:19.196 --> 02:20.362
Ladies and gentlemen,

02:22.404 --> 02:23.862
In this life

02:24.112 --> 02:25.529
there is the human condition

02:25.987 --> 02:27.154
and love.

02:28.029 --> 02:29.446
Human condition is finite.

02:29.946 --> 02:31.654
Love is infinite.

02:33.404 --> 02:34.279
Music

02:34.737 --> 02:38.571
have been with me through all
my relationships and have saved my life.

02:40.321 --> 02:45.321
Our next singer comes from
the Land of the Rising Sun.

04:37.362 --> 04:38.237
Hello.

04:39.946 --> 04:40.862
Hello.

04:41.654 --> 04:43.529
My name is Michiko.

04:43.987 --> 04:45.446
Yoshii Michiko.

04:46.446 --> 04:48.529
Thank you for singing "Diễm Xưa".

04:48.946 --> 04:51.696
What a surprise to find
a young Japanese lady in France

04:51.946 --> 04:55.071
with that record,
it's been a while since I've seen it.

04:55.821 --> 04:59.404
I apologize, but I only know
a bit of Vietnamese, I can't speak much.

05:00.237 --> 05:02.112
Oh, I'm sorry.

05:02.987 --> 05:04.862
I want to ask something of you.

05:06.029 --> 05:08.196
Do you have time?

05:28.196 --> 05:31.737
I'm doing a masters paper
on your anti-war music

05:33.321 --> 05:34.529
I need your help.

05:35.321 --> 05:37.737
could I interview you?

05:41.446 --> 05:42.571
Michiko,

05:44.237 --> 05:45.946
I don't doubt

05:45.987 --> 05:48.987
your seriousness or abilities.

05:50.404 --> 05:51.862
But truthfully,

05:52.737 --> 05:53.904
my advice is that

05:54.112 --> 05:56.654
you should change to another subject.

05:57.737 --> 05:59.987
Unless you live in Việt Nam

06:00.904 --> 06:02.571
breathes its air

06:02.821 --> 06:04.779
eats its food

06:05.071 --> 06:06.529
and speaks its language.

06:07.029 --> 06:08.821
I'm afraid it will be difficult,

06:08.862 --> 06:11.112
for someone from the outside

06:11.446 --> 06:14.446
to understand Vietnamese music

08:17.612 --> 08:18.529
Michiko?

08:19.029 --> 08:20.612
Happy birthday!

08:26.279 --> 08:27.862
When did you arrive?

08:28.404 --> 08:30.446
Why didn't you tell me?

08:30.904 --> 08:33.529
I want to surprise you.

08:33.779 --> 08:34.529
This is for you.

08:35.112 --> 08:35.946
Thank you.

08:36.696 --> 08:37.904
Come in.

08:38.862 --> 08:40.071
Let me introduce everyone.

08:40.279 --> 08:41.362
This is Michiko.

08:41.737 --> 08:42.362
Hello.

08:42.487 --> 08:45.237
It's nice to meet you all.

08:46.571 --> 08:47.196
Mom

08:49.196 --> 08:50.278
Who is this, Sơn?

08:50.279 --> 08:51.071
Mom

08:51.112 --> 08:52.321
This is Michiko.

08:52.446 --> 08:54.404
I met her in France last year.

08:54.529 --> 08:55.654
Oh.

08:55.779 --> 08:57.821
- Hello.
- Hello.

08:57.862 --> 08:59.612
You are so beautiful!

09:01.362 --> 09:02.779
Thank you, Michiko.

09:03.862 --> 09:05.904
Are you planning on vacationing here long?

09:06.196 --> 09:07.612
I'm...

09:11.404 --> 09:13.654
I'm not here on vacation.

09:13.821 --> 09:15.987
I'm here on a researching trip.

09:16.154 --> 09:16.987
Oh really?

09:17.112 --> 09:18.987
What are you researching?

09:19.321 --> 09:21.571
I'm trying to convince your son

09:22.821 --> 09:25.404
to research his music.

09:26.112 --> 09:28.237
Oh, how wonderful!

09:28.737 --> 09:29.487
oh yes.

09:29.737 --> 09:31.112
Music is alive.

09:31.154 --> 09:32.404
To understand the music

09:32.529 --> 09:34.487
you must first understand the person.

09:34.987 --> 09:35.821
Right, Sơn?

09:38.321 --> 09:41.404
Would you like a tour of the house?

09:43.571 --> 09:45.112
- Yes.
- Shall we then?

09:52.154 --> 09:54.112
Are you here by yourself?

09:54.612 --> 09:55.487
Yes, I am.

09:55.987 --> 09:57.529
Do you have a Husband? Kids?

09:58.321 --> 10:00.321
- No not yet.
- Oh good.

10:01.612 --> 10:02.904
You were beautiful when you're young!

10:02.946 --> 10:04.946
Oh thank you, thank you.

10:04.987 --> 10:07.112
This is a picture of Sơn when he was young.

10:07.779 --> 10:09.154
He's very handsome.

10:11.529 --> 10:13.529
Where are you staying?

10:14.279 --> 10:16.029
I'm staying at a hotel.

10:16.862 --> 10:19.571
Why don't you come stay here?

10:19.612 --> 10:21.571
It would help your research too.

10:22.779 --> 10:24.112
Thank you, but I must decline.

10:26.737 --> 10:28.154
Sơn's friends

10:28.237 --> 10:30.196
and his sisters when they come visit

10:30.237 --> 10:31.654
will stay in this room.

10:33.821 --> 10:35.571
His sisters

10:35.612 --> 10:37.653
they all have families.

10:37.654 --> 10:40.154
Only Sơn is by himself.

10:41.362 --> 10:43.404
Back in the days, his songs

10:43.862 --> 10:46.529
were his love letters.

10:48.237 --> 10:50.987
Từ khi trăng là nguyệt

10:51.446 --> 10:53.446
Is about Minh Nguyệt, in Huế.

10:55.487 --> 10:58.986
Trời cao níu bước Sơn Khê

10:58.987 --> 11:01.779
Is about Tôn Nữ Bích Khê, in Quy Nhơn.

11:03.237 --> 11:04.487
Here, here, here.

11:05.321 --> 11:07.196
Cây sẽ cho lộc

11:07.612 --> 11:09.737
Và cây sẽ cho hoa

11:10.279 --> 11:10.904
Miss Lộc.

11:11.404 --> 11:13.237
Tôn Thất Văn's neighbour

11:13.529 --> 11:14.487
lives Làng Báo chí.

11:14.529 --> 11:17.237
That's not true, you made that up.

11:17.654 --> 11:18.237
Sơn

11:18.696 --> 11:19.529
In my opinion

11:19.737 --> 11:22.196
That Japanese girl's paper

11:22.404 --> 11:23.571
shouldn't be just about the music.

11:24.612 --> 11:27.612
It should also be about your muses.

11:27.821 --> 11:29.446
Yes, yes.

11:29.654 --> 11:32.029
Everyone.

11:32.821 --> 11:35.404
There are so many paintings of women here.

11:35.446 --> 11:38.196
Sơn usually paints his friends

11:38.404 --> 11:40.071
his sisters

11:40.696 --> 11:43.612
and especially all the girls he loves.

13:08.446 --> 13:09.862
Everyone, everyone.

13:10.279 --> 13:12.862
I would like to tell you all a secret.

13:13.321 --> 13:14.612
A juicy secret.

13:14.821 --> 13:17.571
Michiko is a terrific singer and guitarist.

13:18.154 --> 13:19.611
Oh no that's not true.

13:19.612 --> 13:22.403
Why don't you sing us a song, Michiko?

13:22.404 --> 13:23.904
Yes.

13:24.279 --> 13:27.404
Michiko, Michiko, Michiko!

13:27.446 --> 13:29.779
Michiko, sing.

13:33.321 --> 13:34.321
I will sing

13:34.779 --> 13:36.487
on one condition.

13:36.946 --> 13:38.279
What condition?

13:40.696 --> 13:42.446
If Sơn agrees

13:42.654 --> 13:45.196
to help me finish my Masters paper.

13:53.029 --> 13:53.904
Oui.

13:56.737 --> 13:57.862
Congratulations.

14:00.154 --> 14:01.029
Thank you.

14:01.362 --> 14:02.362
I will sing

14:02.779 --> 14:03.904
"Diễm Xưa"

14:04.112 --> 14:05.029
in Japanese.

15:51.821 --> 15:52.571
Sơn!

15:54.112 --> 15:55.071
Where are you going?

15:55.654 --> 15:56.196
Kha!

15:57.821 --> 16:01.571
I...

16:01.612 --> 16:02.612
Come to Tuyệt Tình Cốc!

16:03.321 --> 16:04.154
Come on!

16:05.487 --> 16:07.696
How’s your mom and sisters these days?

16:11.904 --> 16:13.029
Vĩnh Thuý

16:13.196 --> 16:14.612
Must be busy huh?

16:15.446 --> 16:16.362
And Thúy

16:17.154 --> 16:18.612
Must have a lot of admirers?

16:20.654 --> 16:21.946
Thúy’s still young.

16:21.987 --> 16:23.154
She only thinks of school.

16:24.279 --> 16:24.779
Kha.

16:25.487 --> 16:27.611
Have you written anything new?

16:27.612 --> 16:29.154
Of course!

16:32.946 --> 16:35.321
There are ideals worth dying for,

16:35.612 --> 16:38.862
but none worth killing for.

16:39.154 --> 16:40.362
Right, Sơn?

16:40.529 --> 16:42.071
I just wrote a new poem.

16:43.321 --> 16:44.862
But when the fighting starts
where can you hide?

16:44.987 --> 16:46.237
That’s why Satre said:

16:46.362 --> 16:47.487
Hell is other people.

16:47.821 --> 16:49.071
Well said Bửu Ý.

16:49.362 --> 16:50.279
I agree.

16:52.279 --> 16:52.904
I!

16:53.404 --> 16:54.196
A madman.

16:54.946 --> 16:56.487
In a maddening age.

16:57.362 --> 17:00.612
Where you go, please lend a mirror

17:00.902 --> 17:03.409
shine a light on this lonely life.

17:04.029 --> 17:05.196
I’m a shadow,

17:05.571 --> 17:07.321
a mirage on the outside.

17:14.029 --> 17:14.904
I too

17:16.404 --> 17:17.821
Have written a new poem.

17:30.279 --> 17:31.862
Oh so you’re leaving,

17:32.737 --> 17:34.279
afternoon, monsoon looming.

17:35.362 --> 17:36.946
Now I am happy

17:37.612 --> 17:39.362
Two hungry hands

17:40.112 --> 17:41.612
Now I am happy

17:42.487 --> 17:44.237
Two tired legs

17:45.654 --> 17:47.237
This time, this place

18:08.904 --> 18:09.821
Pretty, right?

18:11.612 --> 18:12.529
Who’s that?

18:22.321 --> 18:23.071
Bích Diễm!

18:23.446 --> 18:24.321
Bích Diễm?

18:25.362 --> 18:27.737
How come you never mention her before?

18:27.904 --> 18:28.821
Ngô Vũ Bích Diễm

18:29.237 --> 18:30.487
Is she Bích Diễm

18:30.529 --> 18:32.571
Mr. Đốc Khánh’s daughter?
Famously difficult?

18:33.612 --> 18:35.279
- So about my poem...
- How did you know...

18:35.321 --> 18:36.029
Hey!

18:36.529 --> 18:37.654
This is Tuyệt Tình Cốc.

18:37.987 --> 18:40.028
When you're here,

18:40.029 --> 18:41.779
you don’t talk about love.

18:42.112 --> 18:42.946
Right?

18:43.112 --> 18:44.279
Bửu Ý, Ngô Kha?

18:46.654 --> 18:48.196
How can this guy stop Sơn.

18:48.237 --> 18:50.237
He wants to get with his sister!

18:54.196 --> 18:54.987
She’s...

18:55.946 --> 18:57.529
My cousin.

18:58.862 --> 19:00.153
Her house is near here.

19:00.154 --> 19:01.487
House number 46?

19:04.487 --> 19:07.071
How can I get introduced to her…

19:14.904 --> 19:15.612
Diễm!

19:17.487 --> 19:18.196
Diễm ơi!

19:22.571 --> 19:23.696
You can't present yourself to Diễm

19:24.029 --> 19:25.654
looking like this.

19:28.571 --> 19:29.112
Công!

19:29.404 --> 19:30.571
Give me your watch.

20:05.321 --> 20:05.862
Ánh!

20:07.071 --> 20:08.237
Is Uncle Khánh home?

20:09.321 --> 20:10.071
No he’s not.

20:10.529 --> 20:12.654
Then, is Diễm home?

20:37.029 --> 20:38.321
This is Sơn.

20:38.487 --> 20:39.404
Famous song writer.

20:40.862 --> 20:41.654
And this

20:41.946 --> 20:43.279
is Ngô Kha, poet.

20:43.487 --> 20:44.529
Bửu Ý, writer

20:45.112 --> 20:46.196
This guy here

20:46.737 --> 20:48.279
Is Văn Đỗ, photographer.

20:50.237 --> 20:51.653
Today Sơn is here

20:51.654 --> 20:52.821
To introduce himself to you.

21:04.821 --> 21:05.987
Diễm

21:07.904 --> 21:08.946
What grade are you in?

21:13.612 --> 21:14.236
Diễm...

21:14.237 --> 21:16.029
Diễm's attending grade 12.

21:23.529 --> 21:25.196
When you’re done with the entrance exams.

21:25.571 --> 21:27.821
Which university
are you planning to attend?

21:37.862 --> 21:39.904
Diễm would like to study in Sài Gòn.

21:40.112 --> 21:41.987
If there’s a chance,
she would like to go abroad.

21:42.321 --> 21:43.237
But

21:44.904 --> 21:46.862
You don’t want to attend university
in Huế, close to your family?

21:46.904 --> 21:49.154
Which do you like better, Huế or Sài Gòn?

21:51.737 --> 21:53.529
Which one do you like more?

21:59.112 --> 22:01.862
Diễm have never been to Sài Gòn,
so she wouldn’t know.

22:02.071 --> 22:03.737
But I want to travel the world!

22:04.029 --> 22:06.029
Paris, New York, London...

22:06.196 --> 22:08.154
You have to travel to know
where you like best!

22:08.196 --> 22:09.071
Me...

22:09.196 --> 22:10.071
I like Huế the best!

22:15.821 --> 22:16.946
Why don’t you sing us a song?

22:17.862 --> 22:18.404
Yeah.

23:10.362 --> 23:11.112
What is this?

23:12.154 --> 23:13.821
- Mr. Đốc Khánh!
- You’re home!

23:14.821 --> 23:15.821
H..Hello Uncle.

23:20.529 --> 23:21.737
Diễm! Ánh!

23:21.821 --> 23:22.654
Lie down!

23:25.362 --> 23:26.486
I'm sorry, Father!

23:26.487 --> 23:27.904
Why did you let them in?

23:28.404 --> 23:29.237
Let’s go home

23:35.029 --> 23:35.654
Sơn!

23:36.654 --> 23:37.446
Let's go!

23:42.904 --> 23:44.446
Give me back the watch.

23:55.571 --> 23:56.487
You wear it well.

23:56.862 --> 23:57.571
Keep it.

23:59.071 --> 24:00.112
Let’s go.

24:00.862 --> 24:01.362
Go!

26:52.362 --> 26:53.112
Út Trinh!

26:53.571 --> 26:55.029
You’re drinking too loud.

26:55.654 --> 26:57.612
A lady must mind how she acts!

26:58.821 --> 26:59.404
Mom.

27:00.112 --> 27:01.029
Was it ok?

27:03.404 --> 27:04.779
Why don’t you bring it to her

27:04.946 --> 27:06.529
and sing it yourself?

27:08.279 --> 27:09.946
Look mom, he's blushing!

27:12.737 --> 27:15.446
Who wouldn't be happy to be gifted
a wonderful song?

27:16.404 --> 27:17.987
Why so nervous?

27:22.904 --> 27:23.779
Have a good day.

27:48.446 --> 27:49.112
Ánh!

27:50.446 --> 27:51.196
Ánh!

27:51.696 --> 27:53.154
Is Diễm home?

27:53.862 --> 27:55.362
She is not.

27:56.029 --> 27:59.071
Would you help me pass these songs to her?

27:59.487 --> 28:00.446
Yes of course.

28:27.654 --> 28:30.071
I’ll come back to visit soon.

28:31.904 --> 28:33.654
Diễm already left for Sài Gòn.

28:41.446 --> 28:42.986
If you’re ever there,

28:42.987 --> 28:44.654
you should go visit her.

30:20.279 --> 30:21.321
So strange.

30:22.071 --> 30:23.112
Of all people,

30:23.154 --> 30:25.321
You ended up with Đoan.

30:26.737 --> 30:28.987
How can it be more strange than
that time you nearly got married.

30:29.654 --> 30:32.529
Only to up and run away from
your own wedding with Nga.

30:33.112 --> 30:35.612
Oh my god! You heard about that too?

30:36.112 --> 30:37.321
oh God!

30:54.112 --> 30:54.987
Why don’t...

30:55.904 --> 30:57.196
Why don’t you come back
and perform with me?

30:59.196 --> 31:00.779
You don’t have to live here.

31:01.112 --> 31:02.279
Just come back sometime?

31:04.112 --> 31:05.071
Everyone

31:05.696 --> 31:07.779
Is planning a show for me.

31:08.654 --> 31:10.404
I don’t wish for anything more

31:11.196 --> 31:12.446
Than to invite you

31:12.821 --> 31:14.071
to sing with me.

31:14.862 --> 31:15.904
Just like old times.

31:40.362 --> 31:42.362
Have you written anything new?

31:44.779 --> 31:46.071
Sing me your new songs.

31:49.196 --> 31:52.071
All these years, I’ve been singing
the same songs.

32:01.154 --> 32:02.821
I haven’t written anything new.

32:04.571 --> 32:06.821
Nothing new to sing to you at this time.

32:12.071 --> 32:13.112
I’m afraid.

32:16.071 --> 32:19.112
I’m afraid the music has left me.

32:21.612 --> 32:22.612
Left me.

32:48.196 --> 32:49.404
Good morning.

32:49.571 --> 32:50.862
Hello, Michiko.

33:01.237 --> 33:02.612
I want to ask you

33:02.654 --> 33:04.612
about the anti-war songs.

33:06.071 --> 33:07.404
May I record you?

33:07.571 --> 33:08.612
Sure.

33:12.987 --> 33:14.571
You should drink your coconut.

33:17.862 --> 33:19.654
I've never had this before.

33:33.654 --> 33:34.904
Delicious!

33:37.904 --> 33:39.154
This restaurant

33:40.446 --> 33:43.196
Was bombed back in 1965.

33:44.779 --> 33:47.237
I used to come there to listen to
Thanh Thuý for the first time

33:47.654 --> 33:48.737
it was here

33:52.237 --> 33:54.029
When I was studying in Sài Gòn,

33:54.362 --> 33:57.737
I used to come here every night
to hear her singing.

34:03.571 --> 34:05.445
Her low, sad voice

34:05.446 --> 34:08.321
gave me the inspiration for "Ướt Mi".

34:10.987 --> 34:14.154
I waited for her to sing my songs
for many nights.

34:14.862 --> 34:15.821
There were times.

34:16.237 --> 34:18.529
I thought she'll never notice me.

35:00.237 --> 35:02.071
But Thanh Thuý is a muse

35:02.112 --> 35:04.404
for every Sài Gòn artists at the time.

35:05.154 --> 35:06.279
As for me

35:06.321 --> 35:08.571
I was just some nameless songwriter.

35:27.607 --> 35:28.774
I failed my exams.

35:29.732 --> 35:32.316
Our family was in financial troubles
at the time.

35:32.441 --> 35:34.024
So I came back to Huế.

35:35.149 --> 35:36.357
You see

35:36.607 --> 35:38.441
from the very first songs

35:38.816 --> 35:40.398
I've only written about sorrow

35:40.399 --> 35:41.607
and the human condition.

35:43.816 --> 35:44.774
Throughout the world,

35:44.982 --> 35:47.732
They call you "Vietnam's Bob Dylan"

35:47.774 --> 35:49.732
Because of your anti-war songs.

35:50.399 --> 35:52.649
What inspired you
to write that kind of music?

35:53.732 --> 35:55.441
I still write love songs.

35:56.316 --> 35:58.107
Love songs of the mad.

35:58.149 --> 35:59.774
They're still love songs.

36:00.107 --> 36:01.232
But in wartime.

36:01.441 --> 36:03.066
That is anti-war music.

36:04.774 --> 36:06.732
An artist's duty is to create.

36:07.107 --> 36:09.732
They don't put labels on their own music.

36:11.732 --> 36:12.774
In the war

36:13.399 --> 36:14.857
which side were you on?

36:16.399 --> 36:18.691
Overthrow the military dictatorship!

36:23.066 --> 36:25.023
You can’t keep out of this war forever!

36:25.024 --> 36:27.023
An artist needs to take a political stand!

36:27.024 --> 36:29.399
An Artist doesn’t have to take any stances.

36:29.982 --> 36:31.398
Blood and suffering

36:31.399 --> 36:32.566
are unavoidable on the path to truth!

36:32.774 --> 36:34.732
I don’t believe that
truth comes from violence!

36:36.524 --> 36:38.232
Professor! It’s your turn!

36:41.441 --> 36:51.941
Overthrow the military dictatorship!

36:54.774 --> 36:55.691
And now

36:55.774 --> 36:57.941
I would like to introduce a professor, poet

36:58.149 --> 36:59.607
and freedom fighter Ngô Kha!

37:00.149 --> 37:01.482
Overthrow the military dictatorship!

37:19.816 --> 37:21.982
So good to see you all, reborn.

37:22.982 --> 37:25.274
Today, we start a new language.

37:26.482 --> 37:28.357
Thirty million comrades, together we stand!

37:29.441 --> 37:31.357
Like an eternal, majestic mountain.

37:31.774 --> 37:33.773
Saigon Students joined the Buddhist

37:33.774 --> 37:36.774
and the protest against Diệm exploded.

37:37.107 --> 37:39.066
Peace in our hearts

37:39.107 --> 37:41.191
given us life once more.

37:41.232 --> 37:42.482
Monks pray at the spot

37:42.524 --> 37:45.357
where one priest
set himself afire in protest.

37:45.441 --> 37:46.732
Peace begins!

37:47.774 --> 37:50.774
Pictured these quiet
and contemplative people 

37:50.907 --> 37:52.157
Peace arises!

37:52.182 --> 37:53.331
Peace!

37:54.625 --> 37:55.916
Peace, prosperity and independence!

37:55.941 --> 37:56.541
Peace!

37:56.566 --> 38:01.815
President Kennedy and his wife. Taken just
before he was shot today in Dallas, Texas

38:01.816 --> 38:03.399
Peace and unification for all!

38:03.441 --> 38:04.024
Peace!

38:08.732 --> 38:11.148
 To order the military forces
of the United States

38:11.149 --> 38:14.107
to take action in reply

38:15.649 --> 38:17.941
Suddenly, a flutter in my heart.

38:18.982 --> 38:21.441
Horse hooves pounding on the flesh!

38:33.566 --> 38:34.315
Next time

38:34.316 --> 38:35.649
you have to come sing with me.

38:36.357 --> 38:37.857
Turn your songs into weapons!

38:38.649 --> 38:39.524
But Kha.

38:39.816 --> 38:42.441
How can you discern tears from music?

38:46.024 --> 38:47.274
Peace begins!

38:47.899 --> 38:48.857
Peace arises!

38:49.232 --> 38:50.607
Peace, prosperity and independence!

38:50.899 --> 38:51.607
Peace...

38:55.274 --> 38:55.940
Peace...

38:55.941 --> 38:56.815
Peace and unification for all.

38:56.816 --> 38:58.149
Peace and unification for all!

39:09.441 --> 39:10.066
Đỗ?

39:10.649 --> 39:11.524
What’s gotten into you?

39:12.066 --> 39:13.232
You shaved your head?

39:27.232 --> 39:28.566
I don’t want to die!

39:29.191 --> 39:30.941
I don’t want to kill!

39:31.816 --> 39:34.274
I want to be a monk
so I don’t have to fight,

39:34.482 --> 39:36.149
but the monastery wouldn’t take me.

39:38.941 --> 39:39.899
I heard

39:39.982 --> 39:41.149
there are medicines

39:41.232 --> 39:43.024
you’d lose water after you drink them.

39:43.649 --> 39:45.232
You can lose weight fast.

39:45.649 --> 39:46.607
If you’re underweight,

39:46.982 --> 39:48.191
You won’t have to go.

39:48.649 --> 39:49.732
Don’t be foolish!

39:50.524 --> 39:51.732
That stuff is not good for you!

39:52.357 --> 39:54.191
Some people even go insane!

39:56.024 --> 39:56.941
If it was me,

39:58.482 --> 39:59.274
I’d go.

40:00.441 --> 40:01.774
We’re young,

40:02.941 --> 40:04.899
we must fulfil our wartime duties!

40:05.399 --> 40:06.024
Right, Ý?

40:08.524 --> 40:08.982
Sơn?

40:40.649 --> 40:41.774
Good morning!

40:42.357 --> 40:43.941
Good morning, Michiko!

40:47.316 --> 40:48.691
Let me ask you.

40:51.107 --> 40:52.816
Which is more melancholic,
the rain or the sun?

40:55.066 --> 40:55.607
The rain?

40:56.232 --> 40:58.149
The sun is like a life.

40:58.857 --> 40:59.982
There's a dawn

41:01.024 --> 41:02.191
an afternoon

41:02.316 --> 41:03.441
and sunset.

41:06.191 --> 41:07.107
That's why...

41:14.482 --> 41:15.566
"Nắng Thủy Tinh".

41:16.524 --> 41:17.649
This song

41:18.399 --> 41:20.399
Did you write it for Diễm?

41:53.399 --> 41:54.274
Hi...

41:54.524 --> 41:57.274
Is this Diễm’s dorm room?

41:59.816 --> 42:01.232
Diễm’s not here.

42:02.149 --> 42:02.857
Is that so?

42:03.066 --> 42:04.191
Can you

42:04.232 --> 42:06.232
help me pass this painting to her please.

42:06.691 --> 42:07.899
Just say

42:08.191 --> 42:09.274
it’s from Sơn.

42:17.691 --> 42:18.732
You painted this?

42:19.107 --> 42:19.899
It’s pretty.

42:20.566 --> 42:21.815
When you are free,

42:21.816 --> 42:23.357
can you come over and paint me?

42:24.732 --> 42:26.066
I’ll be back!

42:33.357 --> 42:34.191
Quite the catch.

42:34.232 --> 42:35.024
You don’t like him?

43:03.482 --> 43:04.274
Sơn

43:04.649 --> 43:05.482
Sơn!

43:13.274 --> 43:13.982
Sơn.

43:31.649 --> 43:33.524
Are you here to see Thúy?

43:35.816 --> 43:38.524
I'm here to see you.

43:43.316 --> 43:45.232
Why do you want to see me?

43:46.691 --> 43:48.482
Diễm’s going to study abroad soon,

43:56.732 --> 43:58.649
she asked me to give this to you.

44:00.399 --> 44:01.982
She’s giving back your songs

44:02.107 --> 44:03.316
and your paintings.

44:04.524 --> 44:05.566
Diễm,

44:06.524 --> 44:07.857
did she say anything else?

44:08.816 --> 44:09.649
No.

44:23.649 --> 44:26.024
I didn’t know that you could paint so well.

44:28.107 --> 44:28.899
How do you know?

44:30.524 --> 44:33.357
When I wrapped it,

44:33.482 --> 44:35.107
I had a chance to see it.

44:36.691 --> 44:37.816
You wrapped it?

44:54.524 --> 44:55.899
I have to go.

44:56.107 --> 44:57.107
My parents are expecting me.

45:00.024 --> 45:01.066
Yes of course.

45:06.274 --> 45:07.149
Tomorrow,

45:09.774 --> 45:10.691
tomorrow

45:10.857 --> 45:12.191
I'm going B’lao to teach.

45:12.691 --> 45:14.316
Can I write to you?

45:22.399 --> 45:24.316
If you sing to me.

47:27.982 --> 47:30.982
The fighting down there got so bad
you gotta come all the way up here, eh?

47:32.941 --> 47:34.566
I see that you received formal training.

47:34.816 --> 47:36.066
You will take the 3rd grade

47:36.316 --> 47:37.732
as head teacher.

47:54.357 --> 47:55.107
B’lao,

47:55.482 --> 47:58.107
September 2nd 1964

47:58.941 --> 48:00.066
Ánh

48:00.857 --> 48:03.357
I find it strange that
ever since I came here.

48:03.691 --> 48:05.607
I often dreamt of you.

48:05.816 --> 48:07.107
You were content

48:07.149 --> 48:10.191
Walking down some nameless road
of a summer long passed.

48:10.607 --> 48:12.191
where the fire-tree bloom.

48:32.607 --> 48:34.899
A monsoon had just passed

48:35.232 --> 48:37.441
and the roads seem barren.

48:37.732 --> 48:40.566
You were wearing a brown shirt,
hair soft like clouds.

48:40.816 --> 48:44.066
A light brown bow adorned it.

48:44.774 --> 48:46.899
Now I’m miles from everybody.

48:46.941 --> 48:50.191
From my brothers, families, friends.

48:50.441 --> 48:52.523
This place is like a wasteland

48:52.524 --> 48:55.607
and I'm stuck here like rotten firewood.

49:18.274 --> 49:20.399
When the night comes

49:20.857 --> 49:22.274
I listen to Thái Thanh's voice.

49:22.357 --> 49:24.274
And "Người Ra Đi" by Phạm Duy

49:24.399 --> 49:26.357
so sad, so sad.

49:26.816 --> 49:29.066
I miss everyone,

49:29.357 --> 49:32.441
So intensely, resentfully.

49:33.107 --> 49:35.066
The fog has covered the night sky.

49:35.607 --> 49:37.773
I don't have the courage

49:37.774 --> 49:39.399
to carry on with this sadness.

49:46.149 --> 49:48.149
Has school resumed for you?

49:48.941 --> 49:51.316
Did the autumn leaves fall in Huế?

49:51.899 --> 49:55.399
I send back to you the mists
and September clouds from here.

49:55.649 --> 49:58.524
There is nothing more beautiful or sad.

49:59.024 --> 50:02.691
I pray that you are always content
and happy.

50:03.316 --> 50:06.524
I hope to receive letters from you.

50:06.899 --> 50:09.441
The cold seasons here would be more cozy.

50:19.399 --> 50:20.649
Can I get an envelope?

50:24.982 --> 50:25.857
Thank you.

50:29.899 --> 50:30.982
You go on home.

50:32.524 --> 50:34.066
I miss you tonight.

50:34.274 --> 50:37.441
The whole afternoon,
I missed and wanted to call your name.

50:37.482 --> 50:39.024
What are you doing there?

50:39.316 --> 50:42.607
Who are you? Who? Who?

50:43.357 --> 50:46.857
Please talk, smile, and sing.

50:47.107 --> 50:49.649
I’m looking to hear it. That serenity.

50:49.691 --> 50:52.357
Like soft caresses on this loneliness.

50:53.816 --> 50:55.024
I miss you a lot.

50:55.066 --> 50:56.566
Looking forward to your letter.

51:05.316 --> 51:08.941
There’s an unspeakable thing
that must be said.

51:09.316 --> 51:11.691
When one’s most belligerent.

51:11.899 --> 51:15.649
To gain the courage to hear a confession
or a nod.

51:26.649 --> 51:27.857
I love you.

51:31.149 --> 51:32.482
Ánh, go to bed.

51:49.066 --> 51:50.899
How did you come up with this idea?

51:52.191 --> 51:53.149
I heard

51:53.232 --> 51:55.649
that Đà Lạt is beautiful and romantic.

51:56.857 --> 51:57.524
And

51:57.691 --> 52:00.691
You have written many anti-war songs there.

52:02.232 --> 52:03.274
Your personality

52:03.316 --> 52:05.399
In Việt Nam they call it stubbornness.

52:06.857 --> 52:07.691
Exactly.

52:08.316 --> 52:09.649
My mom always said

52:09.691 --> 52:12.691
No one can stop me from achieving
what I want to do.

52:12.732 --> 52:14.482
Except for myself.

53:40.732 --> 53:41.607
Do you know

53:41.691 --> 53:43.649
where Đà Lạt reminded me of?

53:44.274 --> 53:45.024
Where?

53:46.357 --> 53:47.107
Paris.

53:49.607 --> 53:50.482
So

53:50.732 --> 53:52.816
Paris is always in your heart.

53:53.024 --> 53:55.524
Just like how Sài Gòn will always be
in my heart.

53:57.024 --> 53:58.357
This breezy air

53:58.399 --> 54:00.649
makes me think of Paris.

54:08.899 --> 54:09.607
Will you

54:09.982 --> 54:11.399
Dance with me?

54:11.691 --> 54:12.482
Now?

54:12.566 --> 54:13.232
Here?

54:20.149 --> 54:20.899
Can you hear it?

55:34.357 --> 55:35.899
Oh my god.

55:35.941 --> 55:37.774
Go on, I give up

55:53.441 --> 55:54.774
Thank you.

56:44.232 --> 56:45.816
During my time in B'lao

56:46.024 --> 56:47.566
I used to come to Đà Lạt all the time.

57:07.399 --> 57:08.024
Công

57:10.232 --> 57:10.899
Sơn.

57:11.816 --> 57:12.441
Công.

57:19.191 --> 57:21.107
I thought you couldn’t visit this trip.

57:21.566 --> 57:23.566
The exhibition in Sài Gòn got delayed.

57:23.857 --> 57:25.231
So I thought I’d come to visit you.

57:25.232 --> 57:25.857
Oh yeah?

57:27.691 --> 57:28.691
In the exhibition,

57:28.941 --> 57:31.399
my paintings consist of
only the most beautiful maidens.

57:32.607 --> 57:33.732
I even have one of Diễm too.

57:34.649 --> 57:37.649
The songs you've written
are also about beautiful girls.

57:38.691 --> 57:39.607
I think,

57:40.066 --> 57:41.441
You should sing at the exhibition.

57:51.732 --> 57:52.982
Why don't we find a singer

57:53.399 --> 57:54.691
to sing your songs?

58:05.857 --> 58:08.149
Her voice is so unique,

58:09.149 --> 58:10.149
very natural,

58:10.357 --> 58:11.232
instinctual.

58:12.191 --> 58:15.274
But we have to find a beautiful girl.
She must be suitable for my paintings too.

58:17.482 --> 58:18.399
You should get Thanh Thúy.

58:40.941 --> 58:42.524
You sang “Sầu Đông” really well, miss.

58:46.399 --> 58:47.357
Thank you.

58:48.066 --> 58:49.107
and don’t call me “miss”,

58:49.441 --> 58:50.982
I’m not your missus.

58:51.232 --> 58:52.857
This is Trịnh Công Sơn, songwriter,

58:52.982 --> 58:54.899
author of famous pieces such as “Ướt Mi”,

58:55.191 --> 58:56.149
"Lời Buồn Thánh".

58:56.399 --> 58:57.857
I am Định Công, painter.

58:58.066 --> 58:59.648
I will soon
open an exhibition in Sài Gòn...

58:59.649 --> 59:00.774
What can I do for both of you?

59:01.441 --> 59:04.232
I would like a meeting with you tomorrow.

59:07.024 --> 59:08.566
2 o’clock tomorrow noon, Tùng’s Cafe.

59:13.357 --> 59:14.316
Sorry,

59:14.774 --> 59:16.857
but I didn’t catch your name?

59:17.732 --> 59:18.357
Mai.

59:19.899 --> 59:20.732
Her name’s Mai.

59:21.566 --> 59:22.857
Or would she tell you her name tomorrow?

59:45.357 --> 59:46.024
Mai.

59:47.441 --> 59:48.149
Mai.

59:51.191 --> 59:52.066
Sơn?

59:53.982 --> 59:55.107
You really waited?

59:55.274 --> 59:56.691
We did agree to meet.

59:57.232 --> 59:58.855
A lot of people at the club asks to meet me

59:58.856 --> 01:00:00.399
all the time.
But they don’t usually show up.

01:00:00.566 --> 01:00:01.941
Would you like to come inside?

01:00:02.107 --> 01:00:03.274
I would like to buy you a coffee.

01:00:03.482 --> 01:00:04.066
No.

01:00:07.566 --> 01:00:08.649
I would like Yogurt.

01:00:12.066 --> 01:00:12.941
Owner!

01:00:13.441 --> 01:00:14.857
- Yes?
- One yogurt.

01:00:16.482 --> 01:00:18.149
You come all the way to Đà Lạt
to look for a singer?

01:00:19.524 --> 01:00:20.482
I’m looking for you.

01:00:21.857 --> 01:00:22.857
For me?

01:00:23.107 --> 01:00:24.149
Why are you looking for me?

01:00:24.857 --> 01:00:26.857
Don’t you see
that I am dark and ugly?

01:00:27.024 --> 01:00:28.899
I’m looking for a singer.

01:00:29.149 --> 01:00:31.481
With a soul that marches
to the beat of my music.

01:00:31.482 --> 01:00:32.691
I’m no singer.

01:00:33.691 --> 01:00:34.940
As for my soul,

01:00:34.941 --> 01:00:36.774
it’s not one that belongs
to a young girl.

01:00:38.191 --> 01:00:39.607
I already have 2 kids.

01:00:40.024 --> 01:00:42.399
But I heard your singing,
yesterday in the club.

01:00:43.607 --> 01:00:44.732
I wouldn’t call that singing.

01:00:45.691 --> 01:00:47.691
I just copy the way they sang.

01:00:48.357 --> 01:00:51.107
If you put an original song in front of me,
I wouldn’t know what to do with it.

01:00:51.274 --> 01:00:53.066
I’ll teach you.

01:01:18.774 --> 01:01:20.316
If we can’t share a simple yogurt together,

01:01:20.732 --> 01:01:22.107
how are you expecting us
to perform together?

01:01:33.816 --> 01:01:35.816
So, what song do you want to play?

01:01:36.566 --> 01:01:38.941
"Buồn Tàn Thu" or "Thu Quyến Rũ"?

01:01:40.107 --> 01:01:42.357
"Nhìn Những Mùa Thu Đi"

01:01:44.399 --> 01:01:45.691
What kind of name is that?

01:01:46.691 --> 01:01:47.732
Who wrote this?

01:01:49.524 --> 01:01:50.232
I did.

01:01:52.399 --> 01:01:53.316
I’m sorry.

01:01:53.774 --> 01:01:55.024
But it’s a ridiculous name.

01:01:59.649 --> 01:02:01.316
You just need to singalong.

01:02:35.232 --> 01:02:36.691
Why are you not singing?

01:02:38.732 --> 01:02:39.524
So good.

01:02:40.857 --> 01:02:41.691
Nice lyrics.

01:02:42.274 --> 01:02:43.232
Nice music, too.

01:02:44.607 --> 01:02:46.149
Did you steal it from Văn Cao?

01:02:47.857 --> 01:02:49.316
Let’s just say I did.

01:02:49.732 --> 01:02:51.316
You just have to singalong.

01:03:33.607 --> 01:03:34.691
I miss you.

01:03:35.149 --> 01:03:36.607
My yearning is so great,

01:03:36.691 --> 01:03:40.107
that even when I let it out,
It doesn’t wane.

01:03:42.691 --> 01:03:45.024
Loneliness is like a corrosive acid,

01:03:45.274 --> 01:03:47.399
just waiting for its chance to overflow.

01:03:49.774 --> 01:03:51.649
Ngô Kha, Định Công

01:03:51.816 --> 01:03:53.899
They only come once in a long while.

01:03:55.107 --> 01:03:56.191
But luckily,

01:03:56.316 --> 01:03:58.399
I just made a new friend.

01:04:02.316 --> 01:04:03.774
Her name is Mai.

01:04:09.482 --> 01:04:12.441
Her voice is sad,
but also passionate.

01:04:17.691 --> 01:04:19.232
She looks so cheerful,

01:04:19.274 --> 01:04:21.024
yet her voice is full of sorrow.

01:04:21.357 --> 01:04:23.607
Not the familiar, heavy sorrow.

01:04:23.774 --> 01:04:25.399
But a peaceful one.

01:04:28.107 --> 01:04:29.357
Is there anything more sad

01:04:29.399 --> 01:04:31.524
than the sadness
that you are at peace with?

01:04:32.732 --> 01:04:34.607
Like now, when I’m missing you.

01:04:35.066 --> 01:04:36.899
Natural, like how the afternoon falls,

01:04:37.357 --> 01:04:38.649
and the light fades.

01:04:58.649 --> 01:05:00.149
You sang well.

01:05:08.274 --> 01:05:09.191
Ánh.

01:05:16.107 --> 01:05:16.899
I’m pleased to know,

01:05:17.357 --> 01:05:18.774
after a lot of time spent together,

01:05:19.066 --> 01:05:20.357
we could see that Dao Ánh

01:05:20.399 --> 01:05:22.691
is a great match for our son.

01:05:23.274 --> 01:05:24.732
So today,
my wife and I

01:05:25.107 --> 01:05:27.274
want to ask for your permission
to take in Dao Ánh as our daughter-in-law.

01:05:27.482 --> 01:05:28.649
Do you approve?

01:05:29.482 --> 01:05:30.191
You both came here,

01:05:30.566 --> 01:05:33.607
with your proposal like this.

01:05:33.899 --> 01:05:36.607
I have to say it’s an honor
for both me and my family.

01:05:37.441 --> 01:05:38.566
My wife and I

01:05:39.066 --> 01:05:39.816
accepts

01:05:40.232 --> 01:05:42.024
your proposal.

01:05:43.274 --> 01:05:44.607
When she lives at your house,

01:05:45.232 --> 01:05:47.357
if she needs any support...

01:07:17.316 --> 01:07:18.857
I told you already,

01:07:19.107 --> 01:07:20.316
I don’t know how to sing.

01:07:21.024 --> 01:07:23.524
I can’t even sing it
like when you sing it for me.

01:07:24.149 --> 01:07:26.107
No, you sang really well.

01:07:26.566 --> 01:07:28.024
The notes are dead.

01:07:28.066 --> 01:07:29.357
It’s the singer’s voice
that bring it to life.

01:07:34.982 --> 01:07:35.732
Girl.

01:07:36.399 --> 01:07:37.857
This is your fee for tonight.

01:07:38.399 --> 01:07:40.399
You don't have to come tomorrow.

01:07:42.274 --> 01:07:43.566
I apologise for the intrusion.

01:07:43.691 --> 01:07:44.232
Oh

01:07:44.274 --> 01:07:45.107
My name is Minh,

01:07:45.149 --> 01:07:46.649
from Đà Lạt Radio.

01:07:47.732 --> 01:07:49.691
I have never heard

01:07:50.149 --> 01:07:51.024
such a beautiful song.

01:07:51.066 --> 01:07:52.774
It’s truly wonderful.

01:07:53.066 --> 01:07:55.732
I really hope
that you will shine out there.

01:07:55.899 --> 01:07:57.398
If you both don’t mind,

01:07:57.399 --> 01:07:59.441
then tomorrow you can come by

01:07:59.816 --> 01:08:00.899
to the station

01:08:01.524 --> 01:08:04.899
so I could introduce you
to the people of Đà Lạt.

01:08:05.607 --> 01:08:06.899
The singer songwriter duel

01:08:07.774 --> 01:08:09.732
Trịnh Công Sơn and Lệ Mai.

01:08:11.732 --> 01:08:12.691
Thank you.

01:08:13.857 --> 01:08:14.899
Trịnh Công Sơn

01:08:15.357 --> 01:08:16.316
and Khánh Ly.

01:09:18.816 --> 01:09:21.273
You have just listened to
"Còn Tuổi Nào Cho Em"

01:09:21.274 --> 01:09:23.482
by the newest lovebirds
of modern Vietnamese music.

01:09:23.566 --> 01:09:25.399
Trịnh Công Sơn and Khánh...

01:09:35.149 --> 01:09:36.482
Sơn, you got a letter.

01:09:42.607 --> 01:09:43.191
Thank you.

01:09:51.899 --> 01:09:52.982
Why are you so upbeat?

01:09:54.024 --> 01:09:56.232
Letter from the school in Lâm Đồng,

01:09:56.732 --> 01:09:58.107
Quán Văn Of Sài Gòn,

01:09:59.066 --> 01:09:59.982
Ánh’s letter.

01:10:23.607 --> 01:10:24.566
I think

01:10:25.066 --> 01:10:26.107
I must return to Huế

01:10:28.566 --> 01:10:29.566
Because of Dao Ánh?

01:10:32.357 --> 01:10:33.607
It's been a while,

01:10:34.107 --> 01:10:35.941
I haven't seen my mother and sisters.

01:10:37.982 --> 01:10:40.816
It's childish of her to be jealous of
a single mother of 2 like me

01:10:44.399 --> 01:10:45.566
They say

01:10:45.607 --> 01:10:46.732
you and I

01:10:46.941 --> 01:10:49.024
Are like Bob Dylan and Joan Baez.

01:10:51.399 --> 01:10:52.649
We are better looking.

01:10:59.149 --> 01:11:00.857
I'll be back in a few days.

01:11:06.107 --> 01:11:06.732
No.

01:11:08.357 --> 01:11:09.482
You take as much time as you want.

01:11:10.357 --> 01:11:11.774
She's the love of your life.

01:11:12.441 --> 01:11:15.316
I'm just your ugly tomboy singer.

01:11:15.482 --> 01:11:16.649
But if I don't go back,

01:11:17.357 --> 01:11:18.441
I would lose Ánh.

01:11:33.232 --> 01:11:34.024
What if

01:11:34.732 --> 01:11:36.107
you come back and the soldiers get you?

01:12:18.774 --> 01:12:19.774
Maybe...

01:12:20.399 --> 01:12:22.357
... you should come to Sài Gòn with me?

01:12:26.149 --> 01:12:29.357
Quán Văn in Sài Gòn
is inviting us to perform at their venue.

01:12:29.941 --> 01:12:32.357
I will come back to Huế
and then straight to Sài Gòn.

01:12:32.607 --> 01:12:34.357
I can’t be here anymore.

01:12:56.316 --> 01:12:57.441
What’s wrong?

01:13:02.357 --> 01:13:04.149
My life is here.

01:13:04.857 --> 01:13:07.149
I don’t have any reason
to leave this place.

01:13:07.232 --> 01:13:09.066
But Sài Gòn is the epicenter.

01:13:09.441 --> 01:13:11.941
If you perform there,
many will know of you.

01:13:13.316 --> 01:13:14.649
I just want to sing,

01:13:15.274 --> 01:13:17.149
make enough of a living
to raise my children.

01:13:17.607 --> 01:13:20.482
Quán Văn is the cultural center of Sài Gòn.

01:13:20.899 --> 01:13:22.357
We will be welcomed there.

01:13:22.816 --> 01:13:25.232
We will record our songs
with famous labels.

01:13:25.732 --> 01:13:26.982
Don’t you want that?

01:13:30.399 --> 01:13:33.107
Do you know why I chose the name Khánh Ly?

01:13:34.316 --> 01:13:35.066
Because...

01:13:35.399 --> 01:13:38.649
You like Khánh Kỵ and Yêu Ly
in "Đông Chu Liệt Quốc"

01:13:39.941 --> 01:13:40.816
No.

01:13:45.107 --> 01:13:47.524
Because the name Lệ Mai
reminds me of Sài Gòn.

01:13:50.524 --> 01:13:52.649
They don’t let me sing there.

01:13:55.816 --> 01:13:58.274
To them, I’m just an ugly singer,

01:13:59.399 --> 01:14:01.691
not worthy of an elegant, lavish place.

01:14:08.232 --> 01:14:09.607
Go back to Huế,

01:14:11.274 --> 01:14:12.607
save your love,

01:14:15.191 --> 01:14:16.691
and build your career in Sài Gòn.

01:14:20.857 --> 01:14:22.191
We will meet again, if fate permits.

01:15:31.691 --> 01:15:34.607
Come on everybody!
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

01:15:34.649 --> 01:15:36.607
Keep on moving!

01:17:22.191 --> 01:17:23.024
Girls!

01:17:23.482 --> 01:17:24.441
Come with me!

01:17:34.107 --> 01:17:35.649
Are you angry with me?

01:17:40.399 --> 01:17:41.273
If you are,

01:17:41.274 --> 01:17:43.149
then you should at least tell me why.

01:17:53.649 --> 01:17:54.357
No matter.

01:17:55.357 --> 01:17:57.816
Whatever it is, it’s my fault.

01:17:58.607 --> 01:17:59.524
I’m sorry.

01:18:02.607 --> 01:18:05.357
Why don't you stay in Đà Lạt
with Mai or something?

01:18:06.107 --> 01:18:07.024
Why come back?

01:18:16.173 --> 01:18:17.631
Because I only have eyes on you.

01:18:31.816 --> 01:18:33.357
Anh Sơn!

01:18:34.899 --> 01:18:36.232
You have to go! They’re coming!

01:19:05.691 --> 01:19:06.357
Hello mam.

01:19:06.857 --> 01:19:08.357
We heard that Sơn came back?

01:19:13.941 --> 01:19:15.774
Would you mind
letting us have a look around the house.

01:19:29.066 --> 01:19:29.774
No one’s here.

01:21:37.816 --> 01:21:39.316
Come to Saigon with me?

01:22:55.982 --> 01:22:56.691
Sơn!

01:22:58.107 --> 01:23:00.899
Why do you write songs
that glorifies peace at a time like this?

01:23:02.899 --> 01:23:03.857
Should I...

01:23:04.732 --> 01:23:06.316
write song that glorifies war instead?

01:23:06.357 --> 01:23:07.899
During these times

01:23:08.274 --> 01:23:10.441
whoever talks about peace is neutral.

01:23:11.732 --> 01:23:13.566
Neutrality is communism.

01:23:15.191 --> 01:23:16.691
Let me be clear with you.

01:23:17.816 --> 01:23:19.566
The new state legislature

01:23:19.607 --> 01:23:21.981
have outlawed peace.

01:23:21.982 --> 01:23:23.190
It’s because of you

01:23:23.191 --> 01:23:25.274
who outlaws peace,

01:23:25.899 --> 01:23:27.732
that people like me,
will put it back into music.

01:23:28.399 --> 01:23:29.607
Forget that kind of thinking!

01:23:39.482 --> 01:23:40.316
Sơn

01:23:40.941 --> 01:23:42.107
You may leave.

01:23:43.232 --> 01:23:46.274
You should give thanks to
Mr. Khánh, he posted your bail.

01:24:03.024 --> 01:24:04.857
I want you to go back to B’lao.

01:24:07.607 --> 01:24:09.566
And forget about my daughters.

01:25:22.232 --> 01:25:23.232
You escaped military service.

01:25:24.482 --> 01:25:25.857
You don't condone violence.

01:25:27.982 --> 01:25:29.731
You write about the human condition.

01:25:29.732 --> 01:25:31.482
About the suffering during the war.

01:25:32.774 --> 01:25:34.357
You crave for peace.

01:25:35.232 --> 01:25:37.316
You are an anti-war artist!

01:25:38.441 --> 01:25:39.857
I give up.

01:29:01.649 --> 01:29:02.274
Mr. Sơn

01:29:02.857 --> 01:29:03.399
Hello.

01:29:03.899 --> 01:29:04.566
Hello.

01:29:04.774 --> 01:29:05.857
It's your turn after this.

01:29:05.899 --> 01:29:06.441
Oh yes?

01:29:06.607 --> 01:29:07.024
Yes.

01:29:36.524 --> 01:29:38.441
- Hello sir.
- Hello sir.

01:29:39.982 --> 01:29:42.024
The song has just listened to

01:29:42.066 --> 01:29:43.774
Is a song full of passion

01:29:43.816 --> 01:29:45.899
written by a young new age revolutionary.

01:29:46.066 --> 01:29:47.273
I am pleased to introduce you

01:29:47.274 --> 01:29:50.149
Revolutionary song writer, Trịnh Công Sơn!

01:30:07.149 --> 01:30:08.982
Ladies and gentlemen,

01:30:10.232 --> 01:30:11.899
people often joke

01:30:12.066 --> 01:30:13.816
that I'm quite the ladies' man.

01:30:16.024 --> 01:30:17.024
But...

01:30:17.941 --> 01:30:19.315
there is a woman

01:30:19.316 --> 01:30:21.482
that I love more than anyone in this life.

01:30:22.149 --> 01:30:23.732
That woman is my mother.

01:30:25.107 --> 01:30:26.399
Because of that,

01:30:26.441 --> 01:30:29.149
I've written many songs about mothers.

01:30:29.162 --> 01:30:30.328
And...

01:30:31.361 --> 01:30:32.208
What...

01:30:32.767 --> 01:30:34.520
Wait a second?

01:30:46.149 --> 01:30:47.600
Got any back up lights?

01:30:47.601 --> 01:30:49.472
- Yes.
- Focus them here.

01:30:49.473 --> 01:30:50.578
Okay, here it is.

01:32:18.024 --> 01:32:18.691
Sơn!

01:32:19.774 --> 01:32:20.648
Mom

01:32:20.649 --> 01:32:21.941
What are you doing?

01:32:21.982 --> 01:32:23.149
I'm just having coffee.

01:32:23.816 --> 01:32:26.316
Oh, I almost forgot.

01:32:29.399 --> 01:32:30.316
Sơn

01:32:31.191 --> 01:32:34.066
I want you to have this.

01:32:41.024 --> 01:32:41.982
You should keep that.

01:32:42.691 --> 01:32:44.107
Why give it to me?

01:32:45.191 --> 01:32:48.941
Don't tell me you want me to wear it.

01:32:49.774 --> 01:32:50.982
Please keep it.

01:32:51.107 --> 01:32:51.982
Sơn

01:32:52.024 --> 01:32:55.191
You're acting as if you're still a boy.

01:33:01.524 --> 01:33:02.274
Sơn

01:33:03.232 --> 01:33:05.816
I don't want you to be alone.

01:33:09.232 --> 01:33:09.982
Mom

01:33:14.482 --> 01:33:15.232
Good morning.

01:33:15.441 --> 01:33:16.482
Hello, Sơn.

01:33:17.024 --> 01:33:18.524
Hello Michiko

01:33:18.941 --> 01:33:20.774
I'll wait for you in your office.

01:33:25.149 --> 01:33:27.524
Michiko is really cute, isn't she?

01:33:36.982 --> 01:33:37.857
I'll be going now

01:33:38.149 --> 01:33:38.691
ok.

01:33:44.857 --> 01:33:46.399
You have a good day!

01:33:46.441 --> 01:33:47.899
Yes, I will!

01:34:09.482 --> 01:34:12.066
You are a romantic person

01:34:12.607 --> 01:34:13.482
and

01:34:14.441 --> 01:34:15.441
handsome.

01:34:18.607 --> 01:34:20.107
Thank you.

01:34:23.566 --> 01:34:26.107
There’re many muses around you,

01:34:26.482 --> 01:34:28.482
Everybody is curious

01:34:29.482 --> 01:34:30.274
if there was

01:34:30.399 --> 01:34:32.899
any romantic feelings
between you and Khánh Ly?

01:34:35.482 --> 01:34:38.107
We're not talking about my music anymore?

01:34:40.232 --> 01:34:41.982
Why have you never married?

01:36:21.274 --> 01:36:22.816
Come and sing with me again.

01:36:28.607 --> 01:36:30.274
Why are you so sad?

01:36:32.524 --> 01:36:34.399
Where’s the romantic Trịnh Công Sơn I knew?

01:36:40.524 --> 01:36:42.941
This era, I give up.

01:36:45.607 --> 01:36:47.441
Can’t even write a cheerful song.

01:36:51.191 --> 01:36:53.774
I need someone with a peaceful voice.

01:36:54.691 --> 01:36:57.107
To tell stories of our time.

01:36:57.649 --> 01:36:58.732
Because,

01:36:59.566 --> 01:37:00.899
what is more painful

01:37:01.232 --> 01:37:02.524
than to greet suffering

01:37:03.024 --> 01:37:04.232
as if it’s a normal thing?

01:37:06.524 --> 01:37:07.399
Out there,

01:37:07.899 --> 01:37:09.899
there are so many melancholic voices.

01:37:14.732 --> 01:37:17.149
I’m tired of all the groaning and moaning.

01:37:41.107 --> 01:37:43.357
Quán Văn still kept their invitation
from 3 years ago?

01:37:48.899 --> 01:37:49.899
Ánh

01:37:49.982 --> 01:37:51.357
Why so quiet?

01:37:51.857 --> 01:37:53.607
You haven’t written a word to me.

01:37:54.316 --> 01:37:55.941
I think of us

01:37:56.316 --> 01:37:59.482
think of our peaceful love
like two trees, side by side

01:37:59.524 --> 01:38:00.857
on a windless day.

01:38:01.899 --> 01:38:03.566
Let’s be more passionate.

01:38:03.607 --> 01:38:06.774
More sweet so that our love can reappear

01:38:07.649 --> 01:38:10.066
let it grow bigger

01:38:10.357 --> 01:38:12.107
I really hope to see you

01:38:12.149 --> 01:38:14.732
At Mai and I’s first performance

01:38:14.899 --> 01:38:15.816
at Quán Văn.

01:38:16.357 --> 01:38:19.899
The number of guests
has reached more than 1,000 people

01:38:31.566 --> 01:38:33.066
One ticket to Sài Gòn.

01:38:36.482 --> 01:38:38.649
I wish to introduce you to Mai

01:38:38.816 --> 01:38:41.191
and all of my good friends here

01:38:41.691 --> 01:38:42.774
But most of all

01:38:43.066 --> 01:38:45.399
I hope you would be proud of me,

01:38:45.691 --> 01:38:46.816
I really hope so.

01:38:47.357 --> 01:38:49.524
Don’t let me wait again.

01:39:13.149 --> 01:39:15.357
I didn’t know this many people
would show up

01:39:23.732 --> 01:39:24.899
Is she here?

01:39:28.107 --> 01:39:29.191
She’s almost here

01:39:30.107 --> 01:39:31.774
she took the train yesterday.

01:39:55.441 --> 01:39:57.149
It's almost showtime.

01:40:17.399 --> 01:40:19.315
Ladies and gentlemen, please welcome

01:40:19.316 --> 01:40:21.732
Trịnh Công Sơn and Khánh Ly!

01:44:03.816 --> 01:44:07.066
Let us save our national honor!

01:44:07.441 --> 01:44:09.357
Stop the bombing!

01:44:09.441 --> 01:44:10.982
And stop the war!

01:44:11.232 --> 01:44:13.691
Let us save American lives.

01:44:13.732 --> 01:44:15.607
And Vietnamese lives.

01:44:15.732 --> 01:44:21.024
Let us take a single,
instantaneous step to the peace table.

01:44:21.066 --> 01:44:22.482
Stop the bombing!

01:44:27.899 --> 01:44:28.649
Professor!

01:44:29.399 --> 01:44:30.691
- Hello professor!
- Hello.

01:46:54.357 --> 01:46:55.316
Sơn.

01:46:56.107 --> 01:46:57.399
I'm worried.

01:46:58.024 --> 01:46:59.066
Ngô Kha's missing.

01:46:59.274 --> 01:47:01.232
And there's no news.

01:47:02.316 --> 01:47:03.357
A few days ago,

01:47:03.899 --> 01:47:05.774
Mrs. Khánh came by.

01:47:06.732 --> 01:47:07.857
She said

01:47:08.691 --> 01:47:10.524
Dao Ánh's getting married.

01:47:40.399 --> 01:47:41.607
Sơn

01:47:41.941 --> 01:47:43.857
Out there, the rain hasn't let up.

01:47:45.066 --> 01:47:46.691
I've thought about you,

01:47:47.607 --> 01:47:48.357
About me,

01:47:49.732 --> 01:47:51.399
about us.

01:47:52.524 --> 01:47:53.399
I think

01:47:56.357 --> 01:47:58.482
We should stop here.

01:48:01.399 --> 01:48:02.149
Ánh.

01:48:04.024 --> 01:48:04.899
Now,

01:48:06.232 --> 01:48:07.482
I can see everything clearly.

01:48:08.566 --> 01:48:09.399
Everything

01:48:10.066 --> 01:48:11.482
will lose all its meaning.

01:48:11.857 --> 01:48:13.191
If I don't have you.

01:49:04.357 --> 01:49:05.732
I only need you.

01:49:06.274 --> 01:49:08.024
I will gladly trade everything

01:49:08.316 --> 01:49:09.691
Just so that every morning

01:49:09.732 --> 01:49:11.399
I could wake up next to you.

01:49:32.607 --> 01:49:35.316
That was the last letter I sent to Ánh

01:49:36.107 --> 01:49:39.732
I haven't heard anything
from her for 20 years

01:50:02.649 --> 01:50:03.649
Excuse me.

01:50:12.899 --> 01:50:13.566
Hello?

01:51:14.024 --> 01:51:14.732
Sơn.

01:51:16.482 --> 01:51:17.357
I will head home.

01:52:34.899 --> 01:52:36.399
I made you breakfast.

01:52:37.524 --> 01:52:38.649
Beef noodle.

01:52:39.899 --> 01:52:41.066
Sài Gòn ingredients,

01:52:41.274 --> 01:52:42.732
Japanese style.

01:52:45.649 --> 01:52:47.857
Why are you up so early?
Is the bed not comfortable for you?

01:52:49.066 --> 01:52:50.441
This is such a difficult dish

01:52:50.607 --> 01:52:52.149
that I have to wake up early.

01:52:53.982 --> 01:52:55.649
I don't even know how to make this.

01:52:56.066 --> 01:52:57.274
Mom did everything.

01:53:18.482 --> 01:53:19.607
I still remember

01:53:21.107 --> 01:53:22.732
Mom sitting here smoking,

01:53:23.816 --> 01:53:24.774
playing card.

01:53:30.399 --> 01:53:32.566
I haven't met anyone
that loved life like her.

01:53:44.399 --> 01:53:46.024
My work is almost done.

01:53:46.774 --> 01:53:47.399
What?

01:53:48.482 --> 01:53:49.316
So soon?

01:53:52.691 --> 01:53:53.732
To leave this place

01:53:55.149 --> 01:53:56.399
I will miss it a lot.

01:56:44.649 --> 01:56:46.649
Oui.

01:57:35.316 --> 01:57:37.857
Look who's here!

01:57:43.857 --> 01:57:45.482
Ánh!

01:57:47.024 --> 01:57:49.274
Hello.

02:00:18.566 --> 02:00:19.691
Ánh.

02:00:20.191 --> 02:00:23.191
Now I could see everything.

02:00:23.232 --> 02:00:24.982
Everything

02:00:25.107 --> 02:00:26.899
will lose all its meaning.

02:00:26.941 --> 02:00:29.190
If I don't have you.

02:00:29.191 --> 02:00:30.899
I only need you.

02:00:31.066 --> 02:00:34.441
I will gladly trade everything
Just so that every morning

02:00:34.482 --> 02:00:36.566
I could wake up next to you.

02:00:36.857 --> 02:00:39.316
I will leave everything behind

02:00:39.649 --> 02:00:41.482
to be with you.

02:00:43.524 --> 02:00:45.357
I just want to tell you

02:00:45.607 --> 02:00:47.691
that always and forever.

02:00:47.732 --> 02:00:51.441
all the things I've been holding back.

02:00:51.774 --> 02:00:54.524
Is that I dream to be beside you.

02:00:54.982 --> 02:00:58.191
To walk alongside you in this life.

02:00:58.982 --> 02:01:00.274
Now

02:01:00.357 --> 02:01:01.816
everything is too late

02:01:02.191 --> 02:01:04.107
my only dream

02:01:04.341 --> 02:01:06.517
like an unlit flame.

02:01:07.607 --> 02:01:08.316
Ánh.

02:01:09.024 --> 02:01:10.566
If you still love me

02:01:11.024 --> 02:01:12.107
please give me a chance.

02:01:12.703 --> 02:01:13.828
I will come back to Huế.

02:01:13.941 --> 02:01:16.024
I will ask your mother
for your hand in marriage.

02:01:17.066 --> 02:01:18.566
so that we could live together.

02:01:37.680 --> 02:01:39.305
I've never seen this letter.

02:01:41.316 --> 02:01:42.566
All those years

02:01:43.336 --> 02:01:44.378
were you happy?

02:01:56.274 --> 02:01:57.691
Will Sơn be home this afternoon?

02:01:58.357 --> 02:01:59.232
I'll come by.

02:02:02.941 --> 02:02:04.191
I have something to tell you.

02:02:27.191 --> 02:02:27.899
Dao Ánh!

02:02:31.107 --> 02:02:31.649
Dao Ánh

02:02:32.649 --> 02:02:34.816
I know you want to get on that train
but you have to hear me out.

02:02:40.899 --> 02:02:41.482
I know

02:02:42.607 --> 02:02:43.816
I could stop you this time.

02:02:44.566 --> 02:02:46.274
But there will be other times.

02:02:47.899 --> 02:02:49.149
If he really loves you,

02:02:49.941 --> 02:02:51.274
he should’ve come to you.

02:02:51.816 --> 02:02:53.232
Bring his parents to our house

02:02:53.316 --> 02:02:55.566
and ask us for your hand in marriage.

02:02:56.607 --> 02:02:59.441
Like how your brother-in-law
ask your sister.

02:03:04.399 --> 02:03:06.441
I have never had a real talk with him.

02:03:07.107 --> 02:03:09.191
So I don’t know who he is.

02:03:10.649 --> 02:03:12.274
But if he’s a decent person

02:03:12.982 --> 02:03:14.357
and think of his loved ones

02:03:15.357 --> 02:03:17.024
then he would not ask a decent girl

02:03:17.232 --> 02:03:18.191
to run away

02:03:18.857 --> 02:03:20.857
in a time of war and suffering

02:03:21.058 --> 02:03:23.270
towards an uncertain future.

02:03:26.316 --> 02:03:27.899
Let’s say you get on that train

02:03:29.024 --> 02:03:31.352
You’d be lucky not die along the way.

02:03:31.899 --> 02:03:32.691
But then what?

02:03:33.399 --> 02:03:34.816
Will he really marry you?

02:03:36.024 --> 02:03:37.607
And what will you do to live?

02:03:42.774 --> 02:03:43.649
Loving each other

02:03:44.524 --> 02:03:45.774
only takes an instant.

02:03:46.649 --> 02:03:47.941
But to live with each other

02:03:48.816 --> 02:03:50.482
takes a lifetime of effort.

02:03:58.857 --> 02:04:00.066
I’ve said my due.

02:04:01.941 --> 02:04:02.524
The rest

02:04:03.441 --> 02:04:04.607
is up to you.

02:05:43.232 --> 02:05:44.482
Thank you

02:05:47.982 --> 02:05:50.857
- Hello.
- Hello Michiko.

02:05:53.566 --> 02:05:54.941
- Ms. Ánh came by...
- Really?

02:05:54.982 --> 02:05:56.649
...but she just left.

02:06:01.107 --> 02:06:03.107
She came by to say goodbye.

02:06:07.357 --> 02:06:08.149
Really?

02:06:58.066 --> 02:06:58.857
Listen up...

02:06:59.107 --> 02:07:00.982
Not yet, when you pass it over

02:07:01.024 --> 02:07:03.357
you on both ends need to watch
and pass them at the same time

02:07:03.441 --> 02:07:05.481
When you hear the prompt
then one two three go.

02:07:05.482 --> 02:07:07.107
One, two, three.

02:07:07.774 --> 02:07:08.524
Cute!

02:07:08.899 --> 02:07:10.066
Thank you.

02:07:11.441 --> 02:07:12.649
When I first came,

02:07:13.191 --> 02:07:16.649
I had an áo dài,
but I didn’t look good in it.

02:07:17.149 --> 02:07:20.691
And I thought that
I wasn't meant to wear áo dài.

02:07:22.607 --> 02:07:25.399
Áo dài needs to be tailored to look good.

02:07:26.399 --> 02:07:28.899
Even then, when everything is right,

02:07:29.107 --> 02:07:31.357
it might still not look good
if it's not the time.

02:07:31.607 --> 02:07:33.441
Sometimes it could be down to fate.

02:07:35.857 --> 02:07:36.941
Michiko

02:07:37.941 --> 02:07:40.607
Sometimes you need to wear things
that don't suit you,

02:07:40.774 --> 02:07:42.941
to find one that does.

02:07:44.482 --> 02:07:45.982
If mom is still alive now

02:07:46.399 --> 02:07:49.649
and sees Michiko in this,
she would love it!

02:07:50.357 --> 02:07:52.816
As for Sơn, it doesn't matter
what he thinks.

02:07:54.316 --> 02:07:57.482
If you like it, he'll like it.

02:07:57.607 --> 02:07:58.607
yes.

02:08:00.024 --> 02:08:01.232
Wearing a nice dress

02:08:01.399 --> 02:08:02.691
you'd think it's for other people

02:08:02.774 --> 02:08:05.190
but truthfully only you would know

02:08:05.191 --> 02:08:06.107
if it suits you or not.

02:08:06.982 --> 02:08:07.777
Come on!

02:08:10.771 --> 02:08:11.800
Smile!

02:09:27.899 --> 02:09:29.191
Michiko left.

02:09:30.524 --> 02:09:31.024
Left?

02:09:31.357 --> 02:09:32.107
Where to?

02:09:37.982 --> 02:09:39.857
Michiko wants to give you this.

02:10:35.524 --> 02:10:36.274
Sơn.

02:10:38.482 --> 02:10:39.441
I thought

02:10:41.191 --> 02:10:43.566
that you can easily forget your love.

02:10:45.982 --> 02:10:47.357
But it turned out

02:10:47.524 --> 02:10:48.899
you can never forget it.

02:10:52.566 --> 02:10:55.274
To use one love to erase another.

02:10:56.732 --> 02:10:59.066
Is only a temporary fix for your soul.

02:11:02.524 --> 02:11:03.732
Those broken pieces

02:11:03.857 --> 02:11:06.691
can only mend what's on the outside.

02:11:11.232 --> 02:11:11.941
Perhaps...

02:11:14.482 --> 02:11:16.649
I was only a small stream.

02:11:17.649 --> 02:11:18.399
I thought.

02:11:21.227 --> 02:11:23.547
I could flow peacefully through your life.

02:11:26.066 --> 02:11:27.024
But I didn't realise.

02:11:30.274 --> 02:11:31.816
There are invisible waves.

02:11:32.899 --> 02:11:34.482
That pushed me away from you.

02:12:04.482 --> 02:12:05.774
There are many days

02:12:06.024 --> 02:12:07.732
where I am at my lowest.

02:12:09.232 --> 02:12:10.107
These were the days

02:12:10.399 --> 02:12:12.274
I made peace with Life.

02:12:22.357 --> 02:12:23.691
"Cho đời chút ơn"

02:12:25.232 --> 02:12:27.941
Is a song to show my appreciation

02:12:27.982 --> 02:12:30.399
to all the women
that was brought into this world

02:12:30.482 --> 02:12:33.149
to make life just that much more beautiful.

02:12:33.774 --> 02:12:35.024
One of them

02:12:35.357 --> 02:12:37.107
is a young lady from Hà Nội.

02:12:37.191 --> 02:12:38.357
very beautiful

02:12:38.774 --> 02:12:40.441
named after a flower.

02:12:40.899 --> 02:12:42.482
Ladies and gentlemen,

02:12:43.066 --> 02:12:44.024
Hồng Nhung!

02:12:49.774 --> 02:12:51.357
Good evening, everyone!
